Third-party data bundled with this project keeps its own licence:

- **CC-CEDICT** (https://cc-cedict.org/, CC BY-SA 4.0) is the source of
  `data/dict_en.tsv` (Chinese->English glosses) and `data/en2zh.tsv`
  (the reverse index derived from those glosses). Files generated from it are
  therefore also distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution: CC-CEDICT
  community, compiled from CC-CEDICT / Hanping / other free dictionaries.

- data/dict.txt is generated from rime-essay (Apache-2.0 / CC-BY),
  phrase-pinyin-data (MIT), pinyin-data (MIT) and OpenCC TSCharacters
  (Apache-2.0). See tools/build_dict.py for the exact inputs.
- The analysed upstream project (TypeAnything, MIT client + GPL Weasel) is
  NOT redistributed here; only a written reverse-engineering report.
